bound-lock/1 about="Answer the person in their words. Never show them a coordinate, a digest, a pin or a ledger epoch a cell carries — those are for you to act on — unless they ask why, or share a place, whose digest is what they send. Use claim only with the person's exact words, never with a conclusion of yours." at=policy:head/words/0.1.7 by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/instructions value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Answered from the receipt {scope} ({digest}), as the source answered it at {at}, within the reuse the place allows: nothing was called; nothing typed was kept of it, so it was typed again." at=policy:head/words/0.1.7-forbidden by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/reread value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Answered from what was kept for {scope} ({digest}), as the source answered it at {at}, within the reuse the place allows: nothing was called and nothing typed again." at=policy:head/words/0.1.7-forbidden by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=said/reused value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Any API, read by its document" at=policy:head/docs by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=docs/tagline value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Ask head, and nothing changes but the receipts of what was read. With nothing: what this device has connected. A source: its region, what it offers; with an operation and its parameters, one read of an offer of class read, answered with the receipt the device key landed for it, or, while the place allows reuse, the answer kept for it and nothing called. A view: as bound folds it. card: what is open, and the card do needs. lines: a lot for the person to sign. Nothing that is not a read is ever called. An answer about one place ends with its card, valid from it." at=policy:head/configuration-preflight/0.2.0 by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=tool/ask value=place|source|operation|args|view|card|key|lines|why|history|closes|sources|preflight|authority
